# The Release 19 MBS Broadcast branch of rt-libflute: the MBS profile work this repository and rt-mbs-client depend on (the
# TS 26.346 annex L.6 profiled FDT schema, the scheme-specific FEC OTI, suppression of Transfer-Length under the MBMS
# Download Profile, the split expiry setter, the RFC 5053 Raptor scheme and LibFlute::kDefaultFecRedundancyLevel).
#
# If subprojects/rt-libflute exists as a checkout, Meson uses it and ignores this file, so the
# checkout must be on the branch to test.

